  "body": "Incorporating the latest design trends in contemporary living, this substantial 283m2 beautiful, brand new home makes family life outstanding in an awesome beach location. An easy walk to St Heliers Bay waterfront, cafes, restaurants and shops.\r\n\r\nOn well-established manicured grounds, the cedar and Colorsteel home offers 4 bedrooms (2 suites with dressing rooms), 4.5 bathrooms, plus 1 study (or home office) has been carefully considered by Shanahan Architects.\r\n\r\nThere are 2 bedrooms, a luxury bathroom, and a lounge with separate entry downstairs, plus multiple indoor and outdoor living areas. This will easily accommodate grandparents, teenagers or home-stays. Great Granny potential.\r\n\r\nThe main lounge and a lavish kitchen/family area are on the second floor. The dramatic dark timber kitchen features white marbled stone benchtops and splashback, oak floors, Miele ovens and cooktop with a pop-up downdraft and a large scullery with a second hob. On either side of the light-filled atrium stairwell, these 2 areas extend to an expansive, full-width entertainer's terrace that catches the sun all afternoon and boasts a peep of the sea and harbour bridge, one master bedroom with ensuite and big walk-in wardrobe. The finishing throughout is superb, much thought has gone into every detail - an amazing LED smart lighting system and glamorous fittings, intercom, 4 heat pumps, and underfloor heating in the bathroom. As well as an extra-large double internal garage.\r\n\r\nOn the top floor, there is a third living space plus one big office with one master suite boasting an impressive en-suite and generous walk-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nFulfill your family's dream beach lifestyle in this incredibly well-appointed home. Top location in exclusive St Heliers, only 800m from the village and the beach. Super easy care section, with your own private ROW.\r\n\r\nCome to view, you are starting to enjoy your summer. There will be open homes during the Christmas and New Year period.",
